abstract: "Survey of dedicated GIS librarian staffing at US Carnegie R1 universities, with
  peer benchmarking against top R&D spenders, UC campuses, and UCLA's direct US News peers,
  and a case study of UCLA's elimination of its GIS librarian position in 2024."
